0064-glm-launch-tables: TensorFold 0.6.2 port series (apply after the lower numbers, patch -p0 in the directory
that holds the installed tensorfold package).
Origin: the 4x RTX PRO 6000 release series (Apache-2.0), first written for TensorFold 0.6.0 + 0001-0056.
Port: conflict resolved: the qmm extension name (tensorfold_qmm_v5m1, 0.6.1's grouped kernel included).
Files: cuda/kernels/qmm.cu, cuda/kernels/qmm.py, families/glm5_next/cuda/engine.py, families/glm5_next/cuda/exl3.cpp, families/glm5_next/cuda/exl3.cu, families/glm5_next/cuda/exl3_mm.py, families/glm5_next/cuda/forward.py, families/glm5_next/cuda/kda.cpp, families/glm5_next/cuda/kda.cu, families/glm5_next/cuda/kda.py, families/glm5_next/cuda/l2pf.py, families/glm5_next/cuda/qmm.py, families/glm5_next/cuda/tune.py.

